    fix(tests): broaden error message assertions for cross-environment compatibility
    
    CI Python 3.11/3.12/3.13 lanes fail because two assertions hardcode
    environment-specific error messages ('cannot read', 'not found') that
    differ on the ubuntu-lambda runner (which produces 'not reachable').
    
    Apply the same multi-needle pattern already used in
    test_modify_path_unreadable_loader_degrades_before_composition to both
    failing tests.
    
    Closes INT-CI-011
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
